V1, V2, V3, V4, V5 = ("A Nation of Secrets", "The Forum's Charge", "Shadows over Thavnair", "The Tip of the Spear", "The Frozen Capital")
PRES.update({
 "evt-a-nation-of-secrets": [
   P(S699, None, "main", V1,
     "The Telophoroi, led by Fandaniel and Zenos, mean to recreate the Final Days, and Zenos has murdered his father. Krile has arranged the Scions' entry into Sharlayan. "
     "At sea Hydaelyn appeared to you and named herself a primal, brought forth to bind Zodiark.",
     ["M699b", "M699e", "M699c", "M699i", "M699h", "M699g"]),
   P(S700, None, "main", V1,
     "In Sharlayan the Scions work from the Baldesion Annex, home of the diminished Students of Baldesion. The Forum refused Eorzea aid unanimously, citing other duties. "
     "The party splits: Thancred, Estinien and Urianger for an alchemist's plea in Thavnair, the rest to study the Forum.",
     ["M700a", "M700b", "M700c", "M700e", "M700g", "M700h"]),
   P(S701, None, "main", V1,
     "Searching Noumenon for the Final Days, the Scions learn how the Forum's ninety-nine are chosen, but Y'shtola judges that its privileged wisdom is kept from the nation. "
     "G'raha told of his birth with the Allagan Eye, and Alisaie revealed that their father has barred the twins from the family estate.",
     ["M701a", "M701b", "M701e", "M701c", "M701d"]),
   P(S702, None, "main", V1,
     "At the Last Stand café, Alisaie heard gossip of her disowning and found the public knows little of the Final Days. "
     "The gleaners, who answer to the Forum, are ferrying goods by boat, and she suspects their cargo is bound for Labyrinthos, which may hold the Forum's plans.",
     ["M702a", "M702e", "M702c", "M702d"]),
 ],
 "evt-the-forums-charge": [
   P(S703, None, "main", V2,
     "Following the gleaners, the Scions descend into Labyrinthos, a vast storehouse beneath Sharlayan. The gleaners have been mobilized as never before on orders from on high, and Krile is sure the Forum is up to something. "
     "On the way down she seemed to hear a voice calling her.",
     ["M703g", "M703d", "M703c", "M703h", "M703e", "M703f"]),
   P(S704, None, "main", V2,
     "In Labyrinthos you helped the gleaner Erenville catch escaped marmots. He says the Forum has his people working day and night for stock that is edible and easy to breed, "
     "a task begun four days after the Telophoroi's declaration. Y'shtola thinks it was planned long before.",
     ["M704a", "M704b", "M704c", "M704e", "M704f"]),
   P(S705, None, "main", V2,
     "The Archeion's vaults are closed to all but the Forum's reorganizers, and Labyrinthos's restricted levels are said to hold forbidden magicks even Archons cannot see. "
     "Erenville suspects a migration south, and showed the Scions a mineshaft down to the Medial Circuit.",
     ["M705a", "M705b", "M705d", "M705f"]),
   P(S706, None, "main", V2,
     "In the Medial Circuit, part of a Labyrinthos modeled on Corvos, farmers fill rushed orders without explanation. Heartbloom flowers there change with emotion, and Krile seems strangely distracted. "
     "Since Erenville takes his orders from the Forum, the Scions decide to follow him to his superior.",
     ["M706a", "M706b", "M706c", "M706e", "M706d"]),
   P(S707, None, "main", V2,
     "Disguised as toads, the Scions overheard a legislator tell Erenville that Sharlayan was charged long ago with a momentous duty, and that the Final Days mean it must now be fulfilled. "
     "Erenville saw through the disguise but let them go, and Alphinaud reasons that the Telophoroi's declaration set Sharlayan in motion.",
     ["M707a", "M707b", "M707c", "M707d", "M707e"]),
   P(S708, None, "main", V2,
     "By the heartblooms, Hydaelyn spoke through Krile, giving you a flower and bidding you seek joy in darkness. Then Fourchenault had you tried at the Rostra. "
     "The Forum's duty is linked to the aetherial sea, and by three votes the Scions may stay if they stop investigating.",
     ["M708a", "M708b", "M708m", "M708h", "M708j", "M708n"]),
   P(S709, None, "main", V2,
     "Their mother, Ameliance, welcomed the twins and the Scions to the family estate in secret. She gave Alphinaud his father's old nouliths and said Fourchenault lost himself in his work after the twins were born. "
     "Barred from investigating, the Scions turn to Thancred's party in Thavnair.",
     ["M709a", "M709b", "M709c", "M709d", "M709h"]),
 ],
 "evt-shadows-over-thavnair": [
   P(T701, None, "main", V3,
     "A tower has risen in Thavnair, and Thancred, Urianger and Estinien crossed by a new aetheryte from Old Sharlayan to Yedlihmad. Only Estinien escaped the aetherial sickness. "
     "Thancred cannot channel aether since an accident, and Urianger lacks the courage to face Moenbryda's parents. Gouging prices hint at dire affairs in Radz-at-Han.",
     ["M701ba", "M701bb", "M701bc", "M701bd", "M701bf", "M701bg", "M701bh"]),
   P(T702, None, "main", V3,
     "Yedlihmad's trade has died since the tower appeared on Narunnair, though the Radiant Host keeps the town safe. With the Empire at war with itself, every voyage is cancelled. "
     "You met Matsya, a fisherman of Akyaali whose buyer has stopped buying.",
     ["M702ba", "M702bb", "M702bc", "M702bd", "M702be"]),
   P(T703, None, "main", V3,
     "You helped the shy fisherman Matsya sell his catch, since the merchant Khalzahl has no buyers. Thancred learned that kidnappings are commonplace, almost certainly by tempered imperials. "
     "The Telophoroi mean to use their thralls' faith to call a lunar primal.",
     ["M703ba", "M703bb", "M703bc", "M703bd"]),
   P(T704, None, "main", V3,
     "Estinien saw that the kidnappers take almost only Arkasodara, and you saved Matsya from tempered imperials. The tower, called Zot for fiends that imitate Thavnair's gods, holds the captives. "
     "Thancred sends you to Nidhana, the alchemist who wrote to Krile.",
     ["M704ba", "M704bb", "M704bc", "M704bd", "M704bg"]),
   P(T705, None, "main", V3,
     "At the Great Work, Nidhana's alchemists labor for the satrap on talismans that will let the unprotected near the tower. Varshahn, the satrap's servant, brought dragon scales from the dragon with whom the satrap has a pact. "
     "Nidhana confirmed your blessing of Light shields you.",
     ["M705bb", "M705bc", "M705ba", "M705be", "M705bg"]),
   P(T706, None, "main", V3,
     "You escorted Nidhana to gather spiritweed for the talisman's ink, fending off tempered imperials, and she told how the satrap's ancestor forged Radz-at-Han. "
     "Fandaniel, admiring his tower, judges the talismans counterproductive to his plans.",
     ["M706ba", "M706bg", "M706bd", "M706be", "M706bf"]),
   P(T707, None, "main", V3,
     "Fetching giantsgall for Nidhana with Varshahn, you met the Radiant Host, the satrap's order, at an outpost in a hatchery the tower destroyed. "
     "The soldiers know the Telophoroi raised the Tower of Zot on Narunnair and have declared war on the world.",
     ["M707ba", "M707bc", "M707bd", "M707bf", "M707bg"]),
   P(T708, None, "main", V3,
     "The alchemists made a warding scale, but in the Tower of Zot Nidhana was fused to a cell, and Fandaniel took her scale. He keeps the captives as fuel for the primals. "
     "Fandaniel claims an ancient Fandaniel's soul, and an Echo showed him as Amon, recruited by Emet-Selch.",
     ["M708ba", "M708bb", "M708bg", "M708bc", "M708bd", "M708be"]),
   P(T709, None, "main", V3,
     "In Radz-at-Han, Estinien unmasked the satrap's charade. The true ruler is the great wyrm Vrtra, whose will Varshahn carried; Ahewann's line only poses as satrap. "
     "Vrtra asked the Scions to lead an assault on the Tower of Zot, with more warding scales, and you return to Sharlayan to confer.",
     ["M709bc", "M709bd", "M709be", "M709bh", "M709bj"]),
 ],
 "evt-the-tip-of-the-spear": [
   P(S719, None, "main", V4,
     "Reunited in the annex, the Scions assaulted the Tower of Zot with Vrtra's warding scales. You defeated the Magus Sisters, and Estinien destroyed the core, which held a man's severed limb. "
     "G'raha's levitation saved everyone, and the captives, Nidhana among them, are being treated for tempering.",
     ["M719a", "M719c", "M719d", "M719e", "M719f", "M719i"]),
   P(S720, None, "main", V4,
     "Radz-at-Han opened its gates, and Ahewann sent the Scions to the High Crucible for the finished warding scales: Vrtra's own scales, Alisaie realized. "
     "Vrtra told of his sire Midgardsormr, who called this star the last bastion of hope, and warned that you will know no rest.",
     ["M720a", "M720b", "M720c", "M720f", "M720h"]),
   P(S721, None, "main", V4,
     "There are far more warding scales than hoped, and Y'shtola proposes invading Garlemald to strike the Telophoroi's base, so the Scions scatter to consult the allies. "
     "Hydaelyn's flower changed color, which Nidhana ties to akasa. In Garlemald, Fandaniel told Zenos the tower has fallen.",
     ["M721a", "M721b", "M721c", "M721e", "M721f", "M721i"]),
   P(S722, None, "main", V4,
     "Visiting the Studium to thank Scholarch Montichaigne, Krile and the twins learned that every Forum member is bound by an enchantment against revealing the great duty, a forbidden memory manipulation. "
     "Nine-tenths of the members could lift it, and he gave the Scions the run of Phenomenon.",
     ["M722a", "M722b", "M722c", "M722e", "M722h"]),
   P(S723, None, "main", V4,
     "In Limsa Lominsa the allied leaders, locked in a war of attrition with the towers, are sending their finest to strike at Garlemald as the Ilsabard contingent. "
     "Merlwyb asked the Scions and their scales to join. Gaius, accused of Varis's murder, stays behind, and Maxima will guide them.",
     ["M723a", "M723b", "M723d", "M723g", "M723i", "M723j"]),
   P(S724, None, "main", V4,
     "The Ilsabard contingent gathered under Lucia, with delegates sent by the Admiral and the other allies, to fly with the Ironworks to the Magna Glacies. "
     "The Telophoroi seem to hold most of the imperial fleet. Tataru made the winter clothes and will join Krile in Sharlayan.",
     ["M724a", "M724b", "M724i", "M724g", "M724h", "M724d", "M724k"]),
 ],
 "evt-the-frozen-capital": [
   P(S725, None, "main", V5,
     "Landing in Ilsabard, the contingent beat Vergilia's tempered IIIrd Legion and took her troops into custody to be cured. It made Camp Broken Glass its base in Garlemald. "
     "Y'shtola senses vast aether gathering at a monstrous tower, and Lucia sent you and the twins to search for survivors.",
     ["M725b", "M725c", "M725h", "M725f", "M725i"]),
   P(S726, None, "main", V5,
     "Emmanellain's telescope found a girl in the snow, Licinia, who fled past neighbors left vacant-eyed and dead. She shelters with a few others at Victors' Spoils, "
     "and after a bluff about explosives she asked for help, their supplies nearly gone.",
     ["M726a", "M726b", "M726c", "M726d", "M726e", "M726f"]),
   P(S727, None, "main", V5,
     "At Victors' Spoils the refugees are failing, and one believes Varis speaks to them through their radio. The tappers across the ice, dragged to Garlemald to mine ceruleum, want food for fuel. "
     "Alisaie says the Empire is already a thing of the past.",
     ["M727a", "M727b", "M727c", "M727e", "M727f"]),
   P(S728, None, "main", V5,
     "Licinia had been hiding a sick little sister. While you were away, refugees attacked Alphinaud, and the two sisters were found dead on the ice. "
     "Alphinaud took their radio to understand them, and Alisaie wonders whether the Scions should have come at all.",
     ["M728a", "M728d", "M728b", "M728e", "M728f", "M728g"]),
   P(S729, None, "main", V5,
     "Varis's assassination set the IIIrd and Ist Legions at war, with Gaius blamed and Fandaniel playing both sides. Y'shtola reasons the tremor the Populares recall tempered the capital, sparing only those at their radios. "
     "Jullus, a young soldier caught stealing at camp, will take you and the twins to his commander.",
     ["M729b", "M729c", "M729d", "M729e", "M729f", "M729h", "M729j"]),
   P(S730, None, "main", V5,
     "Jullus led you and the twins to Tertium, an underground station where Lord Quintus holds out with the Ist Legion. The Ist holds the tempered beyond saving. "
     "Quintus refused all aid and put shock collars on the twins, keeping them as his guests.",
     ["M730a", "M730c", "M730d", "M730f", "M730h"]),
   P(S731, None, "main", V5,
     "In Tertium, Jullus watches the collared twins, and Ist soldiers who survived the night of the roar blame you for their dead. A scout saw a hooded man directing the tempered for the Telophoroi. "
     "Quintus has called on the Xth Legion and refused the Scions' ceruleum, so Jullus must search for fuel.",
     ["M731a", "M731d", "M731e", "M731f", "M731g", "M731h"]),
 ],
})

